# NOTICE — Lexicon Data Provenance & Attributions

Ratchet bundles an offline, zero-network pre-indexed Radix-Trie lexicon for named entity detection (`src/detectors/gazetteer-data.json`, ~527 KB, < 3 MB budget).

---

## 1. Data Provenance & Category Counts

The expanded gazetteer contains a total of **13,020 curated entries** across four categories:

| Category | Entry Count | Provenance & Sources | License |
| :--- | :---: | :--- | :--- |
| **First Names** (`FIRST_NAME`) | **3,700** | Social Security Administration (SSA) popular given names + Wikidata multilingual given names (South Asian, East Asian, Middle Eastern, African) + hand-curated seeds. | Public Domain (US Gov) / CC0 1.0 (Wikidata) |
| **Last Names** (`LAST_NAME`) | **3,680** | US Census Bureau 2010 Frequently Occurring Surnames (with boosted representation for Asian/Pacific Islander and Hispanic demographics) + Wikidata multilingual surnames + hand-curated seeds. | Public Domain (US Gov) / CC0 1.0 (Wikidata) |
| **Organizations** (`ORG`) | **2,582** | SEC EDGAR public company directory & tickers + prominent tech, finance, consulting, multilateral, and university institutions. | Public Domain (US Gov) / CC0 1.0 |
| **Locations** (`LOCATION`) | **3,058** | GeoNames global metropolitan cities with population > 15,000 (`cities15000.txt`) + sovereign nations and tech hubs. | Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International (CC BY 4.0) |

